  "verification_method": "All port and param indices verified against Fundamental v2 + Rack v2/src/core source via WebFetch of each module's .cpp file (configInput / configOutput / configParam call order). Core slugs verified via `createModel<...>(\"slug\")` declarations.",
  "last_verified": "2026-05-26",
  "notes": "Port indices are the integer IDs cables use in .vcv JSON, determined by the order of configInput()/configOutput() calls in each module's source. UI label position does NOT determine index. v2.0 corrected extensive errors in v1.0 (guessed indices). v2.1 (2026-04-19) added optional default_input / default_output fields per module so unnamed-port resolution prefers the conceptually 'right' port rather than the lowest-index one. v2.2 (2026-04-20, T11) adds per-module `plugin` field (Fundamental vs Core), MIDI_CV and AUDIO_8 under plugin:Core, and the top-level `virtual_endpoints` map so unbound `KEYBOARD` / `OUT` instances auto-bind to those modules — closing T1's audible-playback gate. v2.3 (2026-05-26, T7a phase 2) adds optional `regions` (named perceptual sub-ranges), `curve` hint (linear/log/exp), and `aliases` (alternate names accepted in PDL `*` lines) to selected params — extending the registry vocabulary so PDL can speak in named regions (e.g. `* VCF: CUTOFF = dark`) rather than only literals. Phase-2 extension is additive: params without `regions` still emit numeric literals or fall back to default exactly as in v2.2. v2.4 (2026-05-26, SEQ3 reconciliation) re-verifies SEQ3 against src/SEQ3.cpp: corrects SEQ3 param STEPS from index 5 (which is CV_PARAMS+1, a step-CV knob) to its actual enum index 3 (TRIG_PARAM, labeled `Steps` in the UI), and syncs the embedded `<script id=\"vcv-registry\">` block inside PDL Renderer.html to include the four post-2.0.0 outputs (STEPS_OUT, CLOCK_OUT, RUN_OUT, RESET_OUT at indices 12–15) that were already present here. Behavior-affecting: any prior `* SEQ3: STEPS = N` was silently writing to a step-CV knob, not the active-step-count knob.",
  "signal_types": {
    "audio": { "voltage": "±5V nominal", "color_hint": "coral" },
    "cv":    { "voltage": "0–10V or ±5V context-dependent", "color_hint": "purple" },
    "pitch": { "voltage": "1V/octave, 0V = C4", "color_hint": "blue" },
    "gate":  { "voltage": "0V or 10V", "color_hint": "teal" },
    "trigger": { "voltage": "brief 10V pulse", "color_hint": "amber" }
  },
